Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:08:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: UMA device-local-first placement on the Radeon 890M
 (port of 3a68edb49 onto night/sx8-numerics 1691b758c4)

Same 35 lines as 3a68edb49. The night base splits the Vulkan backend, so the struct field lands in ggml-vulkan-types.h, the chain branch in ggml-vulkan-buffers.cpp (ggml_vk_placement_attempts), the probe and startup line in ggml-vulkan.cpp (ggml_vk_get_device). A plain cherry-pick conflicts on the whole file. No other change.

(ported from commit 3a68edb4984d5821d0fbc24fbf9067108904b1d8)

Receipts: research/local-inference/lane-evidence/2026-09-30-x1-first-contact/
